{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106879","id":2547163444,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6X0qE0","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106879","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106879.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106879.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106879","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106879/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106879/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106879/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b65e999688c1be93880fca7921d62f3597492594","number":106879,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Implement materialX shader loading","user":{"login":"ArchercatNEO","id":108980279,"node_id":"U_kgDOBn7oNw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108980279?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO","html_url":"https://github.com/ArchercatNEO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ArchercatNEO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/714\r\nSupersedes and initially based on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/90918\r\n\r\n@fire this is how far I've gotten so far. Not all nodes are implemented but they're enough that I can load materials from https://matlib.gpuopen.com/main/materials/all without missing nodes so it should be enough to make this progress public.\r\n\r\nIt might be worth checking the `image` node for correctness but other nodes should be fine I think.\r\n\r\nThe main issue is the conversion between standard_surface and godot's shaders. I tried my best by looking at `thirdparty/materialx/libraries/bxdf/standard_surface_to_gltf_pbr.mtlx` but even that doesn't do it quite right. I don't think I can really get much further on that without actually reading what the standard surface model is and understanding how these materials actually get converted into glsl and into spirv on the gpu.\r\n\r\nBeyond that, as the README mentions I'd like for it to be possible to edit materialx graphs from within th editor and be able to actually save to materialx. It would also be useful to be able to bake materialx graphs down into whatever it is we bake into.\r\n\r\nFinally there's the more niche features of materialx like color management, unit conversion and custom nodes but that's quite a bit further down the road.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b2d80c4f-5426-4431-9bf2-49b7b94709f9)\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/845e306d-0719-45d7-9e29-d85660400061)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"m